    "description": "<p>Each other player can, once per game session, highlight how their character acts, speaks or reacts in a way motivated by a strong negative emotion like cowardice, cruelty, fear, egoism or despair, and gains 1 Fabula point in doing so.</p><p>The GM then gains 1 Ultima point, which they can add to those possessed by the villain of their choice. You can choose instead to replace <strong>loyalty</strong> with <strong>mistrust</strong>, <strong>affection</strong> with <strong>hatred</strong>, or to remove an emotion from the bond you have with the character who has activated this power. If so, describe what your character sees as a disturbing change in that other character's behavior.</p>",
